      "message": "I think it\u0027d be worth making a couple of helpers for this, e.g.\n```\nauto const_i32 \u003d [](const Value* val) {\n    return val-\u003eAs\u003cConstant\u003e()-\u003eValue()-\u003eValueAs\u003cint32_t\u003e();\n};\nauto const_u32 \u003d [](const Value* val) {\n    return val-\u003eAs\u003cConstant\u003e()-\u003eValue()-\u003eValueAs\u003cuint32_t\u003e();\n};\n```\n\nWith these and the above change to hoist the bool, you could make all of these conditions one line, which makes them a bit easier to read, e.g.:\n```\nif (!is_signed \u0026\u0026 const_u32(lhs) \u003d\u003d u32::Highest()) {\n}\n```",
